{
  "components": {
    "schemas": {
      "AuthProviderResponse": {
        "description": "`GET /api/v1/auth/provider`（FR-AUTH-09）——\n\n返回当前启用的认证方式与登录页需要渲染的字段，供前端适配 OIDC 等可插拔方式。\n\n`login_fields` 是**结构化字段描述**而不是字符串数组：FR-AUTH-09 要求前端按\n后端返回的字段动态渲染登录表单，将来接 OIDC 时不用改前端代码。\n`display_name` 是 `web/src/api/types.ts` 已声明的字段，这里补上以避免\n三方比对（docs/03 ↔ openapi.json ↔ types.ts）出现缺失项。",
        "properties": {
          "display_name": {
            "title": "Display Name",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "login_fields": {
            "items": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/LoginField"
            },
            "title": "Login Fields",
            "type": "array"
          },
          "password_change_supported": {
            "default": true,
            "title": "Password Change Supported",
            "type": "boolean"
          },
          "provider": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/AuthSource"
          },
          "refresh_supported": {
            "default": true,
            "title": "Refresh Supported",
            "type": "boolean"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "provider",
          "display_name",
          "login_fields"
        ],
        "title": "AuthProviderResponse",
        "type": "object"
      },
      "AuthSource": {
        "description": "docs/02 §3.1 `users.auth_source`",
        "enum": [
          "local",
          "oidc"
        ],
        "title": "AuthSource",
        "type": "string"
      },
